port audio/timidity
type port
reason "timidity is 1996 code whose FreeBSD port gates all its BSD compatibility (string.h selection, errno.h/endianness block in config.h, stdlib-vs-malloc.h, soundcard.h) behind #ifdef __FreeBSD__, which DragonFly's compiler does not define; define it so the maintained FreeBSD code path activates"
target @any

mk add CFLAGS "-D__FreeBSD__"
